From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glevand <geoffrey.levand@mail.ru>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:28:43 +0300
Subject: 0050-ps3sysmgr-lpar-reboot.patch

Origin: glevand's OtherOS++ patch set, refreshed for 6.12 by Sombat Tragoongoson
 (psx-place), taken from https://github.com/damiandudycz/ps3 (files/kernel-patches/psx-place-Sombat-Tragoongoson/6.12).

diff --git a/drivers/ps3/ps3-sys-manager.c b/drivers/ps3/ps3-sys-manager.c
--- a/drivers/ps3/ps3-sys-manager.c
+++ b/drivers/ps3/ps3-sys-manager.c
@@ -645,7 +645,7 @@ static void ps3_sys_manager_final_restart(struct ps3_system_bus_device *dev)
 	ps3_vuart_cancel_async(dev);
 
 	ps3_sys_manager_send_attr(dev, 0);
-	ps3_sys_manager_send_next_op(dev, PS3_SM_NEXT_OP_SYS_REBOOT,
+	ps3_sys_manager_send_next_op(dev, PS3_SM_NEXT_OP_LPAR_REBOOT,
 		user_wake_sources);
 
 	ps3_sys_manager_fin(dev);
